  "modifications": [
    "Adapt to current AFDAsyncExtraInfo: omit removed async_moe_ubatching field and reject unsupported on before launch.",
    "Default V4 async context to the verified 32768 tokens instead of 65536.",
    "For Async CAM graph: keep Attention eager and request explicit FULL on FFN, as required by the target validator.",
    "Default GSM8K strict-match thresholds by model: V2 Lite 0.27, V4 Flash 0.9; retain explicit overrides.",
    "Assign distinct harness-owned DP RPC ports to Attention and FFN services, as already done for baseline instances.",
    "Reuse one service startup for accuracy and performance matrices, with configurable cancellable inter-suite and inter-point settling outside timing.",
    "Add optional fixed-DP imbalanced prefill and long-context decode scenarios with raw counter/token-event audits, DP3TP4/EP4 planning, and per-token stream interval.",
    "Add native-routing 32K-to-512 six-request decode, exact 16K/512 mixed prefill and 128-request 64K prefill; audit raw usage/counters and compare throughput without DP affinity."
